flowchart TB
    subgraph Client["Go client process"]
        Watcher["fsnotify watcher<br/>(recursive where supported)"]
        Reconcile["Startup reconcile<br/>(recursive disk walk)"]
        LocalDB["Local SQLite<br/>local_files + pending_operations"]
        Manifest["DB-driven manifest<br/>(rehash pending files only)"]
        SyncEngine["Event-driven sync engine<br/>plan -> execute"]
        SSE["Authenticated SSE listener"]
    end

    Watcher -->|"record create/modify/delete"| LocalDB
    Reconcile -->|"record missed changes"| LocalDB
    LocalDB --> Manifest
    Manifest --> SyncEngine
    SSE -->|"remote change event"| SyncEngine
    SyncEngine -->|"mark completed"| LocalDB
    SyncEngine <-->|"HTTPS JSON + file bytes"| Worker["Cloudflare Worker"]
